WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 012. THE MODEL IS NOT THE USE.. The same capability can carry radically different consequences in different contexts.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
BOUND THE USE. PURPOSE · PEOPLE · DECISION. Classify what the system will actually do—and who can be affected.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
MAP CONSEQUENCE. SEVERITY · SCALE · RIGHTS · REVERSIBILITY. Add vulnerability, autonomy, essential services, data sensitivity, and uncertainty.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
RECONFIGURE CONTROLS. OWNER · TEST · MONITOR · APPEAL. Higher consequence earns stronger authority, stop, incident, notice, and record controls.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
HUMAN CONTROL. CHANGE · PAUSE · CONTEST · REMEDY. A reviewer matters only when those powers are real.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. A SCORE NEVER APPROVES DEPLOYMENT.. Use the map to expose missing architecture—and escalate when consequence outruns control.

